   211	## Boundary — what this phase does NOT establish
   212	
   213	- **One reviewer is one reviewer.**
   214	  - The adversarial review was one local agent over `git diff 5576a4e ed54e65`.
   215	  - It did not run Popper or the full suite.
   216	  - The amendment-2 code and the refactor carry no review opinion.
   217	- **Reproducibility is not measured.** Each invocation is a single run.
   218	  Invocation 3's success is one run of one learner on one eight-example
   219	  tutorial dataset.
   220	- **Rule quality is not established.** Invocation 3 shows that the bridge
   221	  carries a real learner's output end to end. It says nothing about whether
   222	  Popper finds good rules on other data, or about the threshold selection's
   223	  effect on larger domains (above 32 values, rules can only use the selected
   224	  thresholds).
   225	- **Meaning is preserved only over the exported values.** A threshold's
   226	  ground facts equal its comparison only over the values in the export. The
   227	  import re-checks coverage with GND's own comparison over the population, so
   228	  an admitted clause's coverage is GND's, not the facts'.
   229	- **Popper's other settings are not covered.** Only the settings in spec §6
   230	  were exercised; noise, recursion, `direction` and predicate invention were
   231	  not.
